WEBVTT

09:01.616 --> 09:02.657
Hi!

09:05.912 --> 09:07.829
-Spell, trash can.
-We're doomed!

09:07.914 --> 09:09.664
All right! All right!

09:10.166 --> 09:13.418
If I send out the troops,
will you all calm down?

09:13.503 --> 09:17.339
-Yes! Yes! We promise!
-Okay! Save your batteries.

09:17.423 --> 09:19.424
Very good, Woody.
That's using the old noodle.

09:21.844 --> 09:26.014
Sergeant, establish
a recon post downstairs. Code Red!

09:26.098 --> 09:28.558
-You know what to do.
-Yes, sir!

09:29.477 --> 09:31.478
All right, men.
You heard him. Code Red!
